    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "复合相频曲线是各单独相频曲线之和。快速草图可从低于最低转折频率处的 n × 90° 开始，然后在每个转折频率处按一阶项 ±90°、二阶项 ±180° 步进绘制。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The composite phase curve is the sum of individual phase curves. A quick sketch can be found by starting below the lowest break point at n × 90°, then stepping at each break point by ±90° for first-order terms and ±180° for second-order terms.",
